{"id":"44ab18b3631aa4ec","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md","title":"ZFC Poset Boolean Algebra","display":"df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra — ZFC Poset Boolean Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra — ZFC Poset Boolean Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice]]","[[58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra — ZFC Poset Boolean Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"177489951e58f69f\" href=\"?note=177489951e58f69f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice\">58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a1bd10f9796e9a07\" href=\"?note=a1bd10f9796e9a07\" title=\"58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice\">58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> (poset/lattice carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_B\\subseteq B\\times B\">\\(\\leq_B\\subseteq B\\times B\\)</span> (lattice order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\vee:B\\times B\\to B\">\\(\\wedge,\\vee:B\\times B\\to B\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg:B\\to B\">\\(\\neg:B\\to B\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\\in B\">\\(0,1\\in B\\)</span> (Boolean operations and bounds)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDistributiveLattice}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDistributiveLattice}_S\\)</span> (distributive-lattice predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a1bd10f9796e9a07\" href=\"?note=a1bd10f9796e9a07\" title=\"58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice\">58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S\\)</span> (bounded-lattice predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"177489951e58f69f\" href=\"?note=177489951e58f69f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice\">58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S(B,\\leq_B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S(B,\\leq_B,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDistributiveLattice}_S(B,\\leq_B,\\wedge,\\vee)\\land\\neg:B\\to B\\land\\forall x\\in B\\;\\bigl(x\\wedge\\neg x=0\\land x\\vee\\neg x=1\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S(B,\\leq_B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S(B,\\leq_B,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDistributiveLattice}_S(B,\\leq_B,\\wedge,\\vee)\\land\\neg:B\\to B\\land\\forall x\\in B\\;\\bigl(x\\wedge\\neg x=0\\land x\\vee\\neg x=1\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The distributive-lattice call includes its required order argument; the former three-argument call had the wrong upstream signature.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"177489951e58f69f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"a1bd10f9796e9a07","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"a1bd10f9796e9a07","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDistributiveLattice}_S$ (distributive-lattice predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"177489951e58f69f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S$ (bounded-lattice predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_B\\subseteq B\\times B","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge,\\vee:B\\times B\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg:B\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"0,1\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDistributiveLattice}_S","display":false},{"tex":"